 "text": "Recorder / LaGrange County, Indiana\nSkip over navigation\nLaGrange County, Indiana\nSearch\nSubmit\nMenu\nHome\nGovernment  Assessor\nAuditor\nBuilding\nCircuit Court\nClerk\nCoroner\nCommissioners\nCounty Council\nEmergency Management Agency\nGIS\nHealth\nHighway\nHuman Resources\nMaintenance\nParks\nPlanning & Zoning\nProbation\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Defender Office\nPurdue Extension\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nSuperior Court\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Office\nPay Property Tax  Tax Payments\nPrint Tax Bills\nCalendar\nNews & Notices\nHow Do I?  Browse the County Staff\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nFind a Service\nSubmit a Request\nView FAQs\nView a Slideshow\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Agendas\nBreaking News\nForms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nUseful Links\nStart Content\nHome\nDepartments\nRecorder\nRecorder\nThe Recorders office is responsible for record keeping of all property and mortgages in Lagrange County. Deed Records can be researched as far back as 1832. Recorders are not researchers. We are glad to help you acquire copies of your current Deed or Mortgage.\nServices\nForms\nServices\nFree recording/copies of DD214\nHonor Rewards\nForms\nDoing Business As\nContact Us\nSheila Getz ,\nRecorder\nCounty Office Building\n114 W Michigan St\nLaGrange, IN 46761 Get Directions\nBusiness: (260) 499-6320\nAssistant: (260) 499-6394\nEmail Us\nStaff Directory\nHours: 8 a.m. to 4 p.m. Monday through Friday\nTopics of Interest\nProperty Fraud Alert\nLand Records - Laredo & Tapestry\nElectronic filing of Documents\nSchedule of Fees\nRecording Requirements\nDD214\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make a Selection Property Fraud Alert Land Records - Laredo & Tapestry Electronic filing of Documents Schedule of Fees Recording Requirements DD214 Topic Home\nMore Information\nFind content and services related to this page.\nDocument Center Forms & Applications\nFrequently Asked Questions\nServices Index\nJump to a content archive Make a Selection Document Center\n- Forms & Applications Services Index Frequently Asked Questions\nCourthouse\n105 N Detroit St., LaGrange, IN 46761\n260-499-6300\nOffice Building\n114 W Michigan St., LaGrange, IN 46761\n260-499-6300\nJustice Building\n105 N High St., LaGrange, IN 46761\n260-499-6300\n© 2026 LaGrange County, Indiana\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use\nSite Design and Content Management by\nCORE Business Technologies",
